Subject: [PATCH] Ayaneo Pocket DS: the home of the second screen can come from PocketDS Extra

The menu that AYAHome shows on the bottom screen at rest (tabs Dual-Screen / Application / Task /
Control) is replaced by the home activity of PocketDS Extra (a list of applications that asks on
which screen to open the app, or an empty screen). Settings.Global pocketds_second_home: 1 (default)
PocketDS Extra, 0 the AYAHome menu. If PocketDS Extra has no such activity the usual resolution
applies.

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RootWindowContainer.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RootWindowContainer.java
index cae7d35ce..3acb466dc 100644
--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RootWindowContainer.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/wm/RootWindowContainer.java
@@ -1682,6 +1682,25 @@ class RootWindowContainer extends WindowContainer<DisplayContent>
             }
         }
 
+        // Ayaneo Pocket DS: the home of the second screen can be the one of PocketDS Extra (list of
+        // applications, or an empty screen) instead of the menu of AYAHome, see
+        // Settings.Global pocketds_second_home (1, the default, or 0 for the AYAHome menu).
+        if (customHomeComponent == null && "AR11".equals(
+                SystemProperties.get("ro.product.device.type"))
+                && Settings.Global.getInt(mService.mContext.getContentResolver(),
+                        "pocketds_second_home", 1) == 1) {
+            // Not getSecondaryHomeIntent(): with config_useSystemProvidedLauncherForSecondary (set
+            // for this device) it ignores the package it is given.
+            final Intent ownIntent = new Intent(Intent.ACTION_MAIN)
+                    .addCategory(Intent.CATEGORY_SECONDARY_HOME)
+                    .setPackage("org.lineageos.pocketds.parts");
+            final List<ResolveInfo> own = resolveActivities(userId, ownIntent);
+            if (!own.isEmpty() && canStartHomeOnDisplayArea(own.get(0).activityInfo,
+                    taskDisplayArea, false /* allowInstrumenting */)) {
+                return Pair.create(own.get(0).activityInfo, ownIntent);
+            }
+        }
+
         if (lookForSecondaryHomeActivityInPrimaryHomePackage) {
             // Resolve activities in the same package as currently selected primary home activity.
             if (ResolverActivity.class.getName().equals(aInfo.name)) {
